# familiar — Personal Companion Agent (v0 plan)

A 24/7 personal companion agent: Discord-first with a web fallback, RAG memory, voice/image/video input, TTS output, and browser control of your real Chrome via a Mac sidecar. Single-user (you). Reactive in v0; proactive behavior deferred.

**Not a fork of anything.** Built on `@mariozechner/pi-agent-core` + `@mariozechner/pi-ai` from npm. The original `familiar-plan.md` (May 1) is kept for historical reference only — it targeted forking the now-removed `pi-mom`.

---

## Architecture

```
┌───────────────────────────── familiar (VPS, always-on) ──────────────────────────────┐
│  ┌──────────────┐   ┌──────────────┐   ┌────────────────────────────┐               │
│  │ discord.js   │   │ side-door    │   │ pi-agent-core              │               │
│  │ gateway      │──▶│ HTTP + WS    │◀─▶│  Agent (steer/followup)    │               │
│  │ DM + group   │   │ + web/ HTML  │   │  + transformContext (RAG)  │               │
│  └──────────────┘   └──────────────┘   └────────────────────────────┘               │
│         │                  ▲                     │                                   │
│         │                  │                     ▼                                   │
│  voice/video intake   browser/curl/iOS    tools: bash, memory, tts, image_gen, mac.* │
│  (Gemini STT + video) Tailscale or WAN                                               │
│                                                                                      │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │
│  │ persistence: SOUL.md  USER.md  MEMORY.md  data/memory.db (sqlite + vec + FTS)│    │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
└───────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                        │ Tailscale, bearer auth
                                        ▼
                ┌────────────── familiar-mac (Mac sidecar, separate repo) ─────────┐
                │ Playwright CDP → your real Chrome   │  screencapture │ exec      │
                │ (your logged-in sessions)           │                │ allowlist │
                └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Stack

| | |
|---|---|
| Language / runtime | TypeScript, Node ≥22 |
| Agent loop | `@mariozechner/pi-agent-core` ^0.72 (npm) |
| LLM client | `@mariozechner/pi-ai` ^0.72 (npm) |
| Discord | `discord.js` ^14 (gateway) |
| Memory store | `better-sqlite3` + `sqlite-vec` + FTS5 |
| Embeddings / STT / video | Gemini (one API key, multimodal) |
| TTS | OpenAI default (configurable: ElevenLabs, Cartesia) |
| Image-gen | OpenAI default (configurable: Gemini Imagen, Stability) |
| Browser | Playwright (Mac sidecar) → your Chrome via `--remote-debugging-port` |
| WebUI | Vanilla HTML + ~200 LOC JS, served by side-door |
| Process | Single `familiar` CLI binary, systemd-managed |

